      "Simon Says is probably the safest choice when you're not sure what to pick: almost every child knows the rules, and it takes real movement that you can match to the pace and age of the group. For a bigger group, The Great Team Challenge adds a competitive structure to the movement. Match the intensity to the space: in a small room choose a gentler version with movement on the spot, and in a big yard you can let go completely.",
